Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Er.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.91,0:00:07.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.32,0:01:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.84,0:01:36.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T.K.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.75,0:01:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was the next to find his crest,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.94,0:01:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it led us to a place where\NIzzy made quite a discovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.60,0:01:43.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He came to the conclusion that we\Nare all inside a giant program,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.88,0:01:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and even us kids are just\Npieces of computer data.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.52,0:01:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With this new information, our leader,\NTai, now thinks he's invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.44,0:01:55.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we were sent an email from\Nsomeone being held by Etemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.20,0:01:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Following the signal,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.24,0:02:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We found Datamon, a robot-like\NDigi who controls Edamon's network.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.18,0:02:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We released him from Edamon's control,\Nand just like that, he takes Sora.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.48,0:02:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice guy, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.60,0:02:14.98,Sign,,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}Perfect Level Evolution! MetalGreymon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.22,0:02:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When Datamon wasn't able to\Nget his revenge on Etemon,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.76,0:02:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he kidnapped Sora and Beemon and took off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.00,0:02:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we don't have a clue where\Nto start looking for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.38,0:02:26.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, we could all end up dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.20,0:02:27.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.22,0:02:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if Datamon does something to harm\NSora while we sit here on our butts?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.76,0:02:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, Tai, he's already\Nbeaten our brains out once.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.46,0:02:35.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What makes you think he won't do it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.30,0:02:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to come up with a\Nplan before we go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.06,0:02:40.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is more depressing than a soap opera.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.82,0:02:43.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We better get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.32,0:02:46.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll stay next to you guys just\Nin case any of you get scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.12,0:02:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, thanks. Good night, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.16,0:02:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's tough not knowing what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.38,0:02:57.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The minute I saw what was happening,\NI should have gone after her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.04,0:02:59.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use blaming yourself, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.12,0:03:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're really all to blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.64,0:03:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and we're all going to\Nfind a way to get her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.20,0:03:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I've got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.76,0:03:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know where Sora is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.30,0:03:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think Datamon only\Npretended to take her away,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.26,0:03:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when in reality, they've been\Nright here the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.16,0:03:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me that they're\Nstill right here in the pyramid?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.90,0:03:17.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.94,0:03:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've discovered that way down below\Nthe pyramid, there's a secret room.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.12,0:03:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I just know that's\Nwhere he's holding them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.94,0:03:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's found the perfect hiding place right\Nunder Edemon's nose Not a bad place,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.48,0:03:29.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as long as he isn't sneezing
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.54,0:03:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be a way in I don't care what\NI've gotta do I'm gonna find that room,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.06,0:03:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'm gonna bring Sora back Guys, I\Ntotally understand if you'd rather wait here
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.20,0:03:42.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough with the guilt trip, I'm coming\Nwith ya Remember the old saying,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.92,0:03:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, there's no I in team\NCan I come too if I'm brave?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.76,0:03:47.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright then
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.24,0:03:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, let's go get Sora!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.04,0:03:58.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have I been dreaming?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.86,0:04:00.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't my bedroom, where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.92,0:04:03.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Biyomon, it isn't a dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.32,0:04:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be alarmed, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.58,0:04:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's simply exhausted\Nfrom all the excitement.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.98,0:04:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'll be fine when I use her\Nin my plan to destroy Etemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.16,0:04:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Biyomon can't Digivolve without me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.84,0:04:20.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'd rather be stuck in a\Nsewer full of rats than help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.46,0:04:22.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good, then, I'll remember you said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.14,0:04:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.76,0:04:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just remain calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.84,0:04:28.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.96,0:04:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get me off this thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.98,0:04:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've just stopped!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.10,0:04:36.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.50,0:04:39.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.82,0:04:41.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.68,0:04:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Relax, I'm just making\Na copy of you. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.82,0:04:49.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, I believe Biomond's power\Nhas nothing to do with you, my dear,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.46,0:04:51.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but rather whoever happens\Nto be in possession
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.70,0:04:54.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of that fancy Digivice\Nyou so proudly wear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.40,0:04:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will never be able to command Biyomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.24,0:05:01.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps not, but we'll see if an\Nexact replica of you can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.92,0:05:03.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This just can't be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.60,0:05:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could be wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.20,0:05:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I fought the beast before,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.20,0:05:11.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Etemon destroyed all of my memory\Ncircuits except for those of the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.96,0:05:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From that moment on, I\Nvowed I'd have my revenge,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.56,0:05:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I will have it with\Nthe help of your Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.48,0:05:23.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But enough of this small talk already,\Nmy dear The moment of truth has arrived
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.00,0:05:31.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.91,0:05:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with so many of the Digimon\Nsurrounding the pyramid like this There
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.96,0:05:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is just no way we can get in there\Nwithout somebody seeing us Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.68,0:05:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's exactly why we're going\Nto be acting as decoys Right
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.40,0:05:44.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Tai,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.32,0:05:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when the enemy starts\Nchasing after us You and
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.18,0:05:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon have got to get\Ninside the pyramid quickly,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.48,0:05:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,without being seen by anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.08,0:05:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.64,0:05:54.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do have directions for me, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.80,0:05:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, just one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.94,0:05:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come I want to throw up every\Ntime you say one more thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.68,0:05:59.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.59,0:06:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To enter the secret room, you\Nhave to take a hidden passage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.46,0:06:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's another electrified wall to get\Npast, just like the room Datamon was in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.98,0:06:08.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.44,0:06:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.88,0:06:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think you can make it, Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.18,0:06:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what the wall is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.00,0:06:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going through.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.68,0:06:24.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, try not to do anything stupid and\Nstay out of unnecessary trouble, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.00,0:06:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, the important\Nthing is saving Sora.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.68,0:06:28.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.59,0:06:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you guys try not to do\Nanything stupid either, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.22,0:06:34.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you run into Etemon, just turn\Naround and run the other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.20,0:06:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got that, TK? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.14,0:06:40.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoever doesn't come back alive is\Ngoing to be in a lot of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.24,0:06:41.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.70,0:06:45.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this plan works, everybody has\Nto get their part exactly right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.82,0:06:47.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're coming out of the pyramid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.92,0:06:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take cover, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.88,0:06:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Battle positions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.70,0:06:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Mimi. You're welcome. Get down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.04,0:07:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harpoon torpedo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.90,0:07:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Earthquake, get under the desk!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.42,0:07:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.80,0:07:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.54,0:07:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ikkakumon is bombing us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.40,0:07:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll bomb him back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.70,0:07:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, be brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.58,0:07:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.62,0:07:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Garurumon, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.46,0:07:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, all you clowns.\NCome on! Follow us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.96,0:07:54.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.87,0:07:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.79,0:07:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're running away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.82,0:07:57.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.73,0:07:58.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.65,0:08:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is when they should be\Nattacking with everything they got.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.48,0:08:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know this is something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.50,0:08:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't like the smell of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.86,0:08:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't me, boss, but listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.58,0:08:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They and I did something\Nto jam up the network.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.52,0:08:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we can't find any evidence as\Nto where the Blackguard might be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.68,0:08:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to see your face\Nagain until you find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.12,0:08:12.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.03,0:08:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boss, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.95,0:08:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, don't be bugging me\Nwith the little details.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.26,0:08:16.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.16,0:08:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be rid of all\Nthem troublemakers today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.24,0:08:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope Joe and Matt make it okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.86,0:08:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Izzy, let's move out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.62,0:08:34.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.53,0:08:35.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He forgot his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.66,0:08:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.02,0:08:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you get to the\Nwall, just keep running.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.36,0:08:41.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.40,0:08:45.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So far so good. This is the right way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.38,0:08:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm sure oh the passage is blocked it's a
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.00,0:08:56.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dead end not necessarily why don't we try\Nthat door over there it's clear let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.10,0:09:09.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hey did you notice anything on the middle\Nmonitor yeah you're attracting flies again
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.92,0:09:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and Matt need our help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.60,0:09:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Palmon, you've got\Nto ditch it off right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.70,0:09:20.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.61,0:09:22.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, remember, TK, don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.80,0:09:28.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Summon the dark network.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.78,0:09:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.38,0:09:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, you're becoming a\Nnuisance, son. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.50,0:09:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because I'm a teenager.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.04,0:09:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to admit, it's been a lot of fun\Ntoying with you, but now playtime's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.26,0:09:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the end of the line\Nfor you and your goat, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.68,0:10:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your friends are very perceptive, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.40,0:10:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems they've already discovered that\NI'm holding you prisoner in this pyramid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.52,0:10:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that explosion?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.72,0:10:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a ferocious battle raging outside,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.58,0:10:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and several of your friends have\Neven managed to enter the pyramid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.96,0:10:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.52,0:10:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.76,0:10:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I caught to my tape!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.12,0:10:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said it was fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.72,0:10:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fast forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.82,0:10:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I ain't running away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.80,0:10:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Howling blaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.34,0:10:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that the best you've got?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.14,0:10:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've seen sharper needles\Nin Granny's knitting bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.72,0:10:49.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we need a new plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.86,0:10:52.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, little playmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.36,0:10:53.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me what you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.88,0:10:56.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garurumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.26,0:11:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ikkakumon, get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.48,0:11:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Needle Spray!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.46,0:11:19.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to close the show with a tune\Nthat's currently number one on the charts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.76,0:11:21.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It goes something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.92,0:11:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My little darling, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.30,0:11:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you'll swear, you think I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.74,0:11:30.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just can't stand it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.38,0:11:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the boy, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.14,0:11:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.00,0:11:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't forget to tip your waitress.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.00,0:11:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Etemon, I've discovered the\Nwhereabouts of the other children, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.20,0:11:44.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are inside the pyramid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.94,0:11:49.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would they be in unless Datamon\Nis still inside the pyramid?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.30,0:11:54.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Datamon's smarter than I thought,\Nbut not nearly as smart as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.66,0:11:55.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.57,0:11:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, where did all those others go?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.26,0:12:00.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's a legend got to do to keep\Nan audience around here, baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.28,0:12:01.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.34,0:12:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just destroy the\Nones in the pyramid first.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.36,0:12:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then I'll come back\Nfor the rest of them later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.68,0:12:06.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.62,0:12:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's got a lot of anger\Nand he sure gets mad
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.28,0:12:15.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,easily at least we can\Nstill laugh about it
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.86,0:12:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but what about time oh\Nthat's right something
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.60,0:12:22.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tells me he's not laughing right about now
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.72,0:12:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,looks like the gazimata\Nfigured out we're here
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.14,0:12:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we're so close to\Nthe room i think the main
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.76,0:12:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,passage that leads to the\Nprivate entrance to edamon's
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.46,0:12:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lab is located at the bottom\Nof this. Let's move. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.26,0:12:39.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.84,0:12:40.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.66,0:12:46.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, before I cancel you like a\Nbad sitcom, wreck me to Datamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.30,0:12:51.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't find Sora! Tentomon,\Ndigivolve! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.34,0:12:54.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.38,0:12:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tentomon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.74,0:12:57.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.65,0:12:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tentomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.86,0:12:59.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kabuterimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.54,0:13:01.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.45,0:13:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold him, Kabuterimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.96,0:13:04.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.20,0:13:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.88,0:13:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An electric wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.62,0:13:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can break through it, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.36,0:13:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I'll do it, Agumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.82,0:13:18.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.68,0:13:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.56,0:13:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if I don't do this on my\Nown, right here, right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.60,0:13:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may never be able to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.44,0:13:30.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.35,0:13:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A man must face himself before\Nhe can face his enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.24,0:13:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I understand, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.00,0:13:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.40,0:13:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.28,0:13:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.40,0:13:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.32,0:13:51.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yippee!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.08,0:13:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, we need Agumon again! Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.06,0:14:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon. Agumon. Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.56,0:14:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.34,0:14:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, help me! Sora, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.14,0:14:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.72,0:14:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.06,0:14:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora, speak to me! Sora!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.96,0:14:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not Sora!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.84,0:14:20.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just a copy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.72,0:14:21.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.68,0:14:24.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now the copy is finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.50,0:14:26.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will give her the magic\Npress and she will become
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.64,0:14:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the new Sora and do\Nwhatever I require of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.40,0:14:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what you think, you pile of junk!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.24,0:14:32.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.15,0:14:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.10,0:14:36.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot permit a mere boy to\Nspoil my plans for vengeance!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.70,0:14:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming, Sora! Ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.68,0:14:43.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beoman!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.78,0:14:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is the center of\NEtemon's dark power network.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.70,0:14:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything sucked in there\Nis lost to all eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.52,0:14:58.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since I have no more use for the\Noriginal, I'll simply get rid of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.82,0:15:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai! The crest! Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.28,0:15:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the crest is the means by which\Nyou may save the maiden's life,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.38,0:15:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you give it to me immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.38,0:15:11.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, why don't you go tell Etemon your\Nsad story, because we're not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.12,0:15:12.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora, catch! No, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.80,0:15:14.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not scared, are you, Datamon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.78,0:15:16.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Etemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.22,0:15:20.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Etemon, Duckyball, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.36,0:15:23.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pegasmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.78,0:15:26.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay back, you blasted crow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.02,0:15:28.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think I'm doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.20,0:15:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.34,0:15:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry, kid-head.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.50,0:15:33.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll play with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.22,0:15:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.30,0:15:41.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never thought I'd see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.18,0:15:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, here come the others. Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.56,0:15:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're over here! There we are!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.46,0:15:50.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.37,0:15:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.48,0:15:54.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without the dress, this thing is useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.98,0:16:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now it's time for me to\Ndismantle you in the same way you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.10,0:16:03.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dismantled your little playmate\Nyou miserable pile of bolts
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.88,0:16:12.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if i'm going down you're coming with\Nme into the black pit just right here
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.98,0:16:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now i'm not going to tell\Nyou again let go of me or
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.54,0:16:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm going to open you up\Nlike a can of bean those were
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.80,0:16:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,computer viruses i dropped\Ninto the black pit It will
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.68,0:16:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,keep growing and absorb all\Nthe dark energy of our cosmos,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.60,0:16:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,including yours, fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.90,0:16:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know how I hate bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.96,0:16:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get me out of here. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.96,0:16:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.44,0:16:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suspect the computer blew.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.52,0:16:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at the pyramid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.86,0:16:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's disintegrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.10,0:17:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, now, let me\Nsee a show of hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.20,0:17:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many actually missed me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.68,0:17:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.32,0:17:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you I'd come back\Nand take my revenge on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.34,0:17:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't believe me, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.88,0:17:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.84,0:17:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Electro-shocker!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.36,0:17:26.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that was pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.96,0:17:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I give it a 9.6.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.62,0:17:30.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, you ready for a fastball?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.38,0:17:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That one's headed right for the Sphinx.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.12,0:17:43.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Sphinx melted!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.62,0:17:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Melting doesn't even describe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.32,0:17:46.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've tried everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.56,0:17:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing can stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.54,0:17:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess this is the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.60,0:17:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was hoping to skip algebra\Nclass, but not like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.36,0:17:55.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not ready to\Nsurrender to Etemon just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.60,0:17:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coming, Koromon?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.64,0:18:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.26,0:18:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we got here, sports fans?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.06,0:18:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A new batter, step to the plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.90,0:18:06.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid of you, you big blowhard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.58,0:18:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come down here and fight like a mod.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.24,0:18:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.84,0:18:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.88,0:18:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you are brave. I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.16,0:18:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Koromon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.22,0:18:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm staying with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.28,0:18:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, your courage is giving\Nme even greater strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.46,0:18:24.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can digivol!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.82,0:18:25.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.22,0:18:28.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.08,0:18:30.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.24,0:18:31.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.36,0:18:33.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.27,0:18:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.38,0:18:35.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.26,0:18:38.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.17,0:18:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolve too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.34,0:18:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Battle Deramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.74,0:18:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at me, you're a fully of all Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.70,0:19:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I can handle him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.12,0:19:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just watch me, kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.56,0:19:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Metal Greymon?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.70,0:19:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was the power from the press.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.16,0:19:14.17,Sign,,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}MetalGreymon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.16,0:19:14.17,Sign,,370,0,140,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.16,0:19:14.17,Sign,,370,0,185,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Vaccine
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.16,0:19:14.17,Sign,,370,0,235,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Cyborg Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.16,0:19:14.17,Sign,,370,0,335,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.16,0:19:14.17,Sign,,370,0,375,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Giga Destroyer
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.58,0:19:08.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Metal Greymon uses his own\Nbody as a weapon during battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.52,0:19:12.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His most lethal instrument\Nis the Geisha Destroyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.02,0:19:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is everybody's enemy! Use the power\Nof the crash! What's with you? Is
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.06,0:19:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there no end to your stupidity well\Nmaybe i can put an end to it for you
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.08,0:19:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was just a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.78,0:19:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,finish him now while we have the power
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.00,0:19:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,go back off baby
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.06,0:19:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ow what's the matter\Nwith you don't you know
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.40,0:19:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the rules there's no head-butting allowed
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.80,0:19:45.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's blowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.10,0:19:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish Meyer could do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.54,0:19:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the Crest Tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.94,0:19:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, don't destroy me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.80,0:19:52.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got too much talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.22,0:19:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a blaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.72,0:19:58.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.30,0:20:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must not defeat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.24,0:20:05.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just too important to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.10,0:20:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let go of me, MetalGreymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.72,0:20:26.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.00,0:20:28.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.84,0:20:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.18,0:20:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.20,0:20:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are all these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.80,0:20:45.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.52,0:20:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.70,0:20:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.98,0:20:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.08,0:21:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish. How do you feel here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.94,0:21:29.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish. How do you feel here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.85,0:21:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please tell me right now,\NI can't see all things.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.80,0:21:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.22,0:21:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cold,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.80,0:21:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's cold. It's a jacket that's a
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.82,0:21:49.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,good one It's time to say that I love you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.02,0:21:56.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a hope that you're\Ngoing to be. The sun
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.10,0:22:01.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,will shine on your eyes.\NI can't remember you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.60,0:22:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,THE DIGIMON ADVENTURE
